# Secrets — never commit (CLAUDE.md golden rule: two processes, two tokens)
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Tooling caches (pytest for rules/, optional linters/type-checkers)
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
# Note: uv.lock is intentionally NOT ignored — commit it for reproducible installs.

# Audio temp — Piper output / Bot A WAVs (Windows OS temp dir, never /tmp)
*.wav

# Piper voice models — large binaries, downloaded per SETUP.md B5 (not committed)
voices/

# Logs (pipeline PCM/transcript/debug logs)
*.log

# data/ — ALLOWLIST: ignore everything, then re-track only the curated SEED/REFERENCE files that
# ship with the repo (hand-written/checked-in: system profiles, the German lore + rules glossary,
# the live party JSONs, the _example session, the live channel's characters.json). Everything
# GENERATED or bought-book-derived stays local: PDFs, adventures/ scene cards, real per-channel
# state (state.json/history/recap/sheets), vectordb/rag.db. .gitkeep keeps the empty dir skeleton.
# GOTCHA when adding data: a new committed file needs its OWN `!`-rule below, and the `*.json` /
# `*.md` rules match the folder's TOP level only — a new subfolder or channel needs a new line.
data/**
!data/
!data/systems/
!data/pdfs/
!data/sessions/
!data/vectordb/
!data/lore/
!data/lore/*.md
!data/party/
!data/party/*.json
!data/party/*.md
!data/rules_de/
!data/rules_de/*.md
# the RAG calibration report quotes rulebook headings + distances — keep it local
tools/rag_calibrate_report.md
!data/**/.gitkeep
# …but DO track hand-written/checked-in fixtures (ADR 005/012/021): the hand-written system
# profiles, the example party, and the curated lore compendium (data/lore/ — own wording of
# freely available 40k common knowledge, not book-derivative). Real per-channel session state
# (data/sessions/<id>/) stays ignored.
!data/systems/*.json
!data/sessions/_example/
!data/sessions/_example/*.json
# the live circlejerk party ships so the bot runs on a teammate's clone (loaded at !join);
# only characters.json — runtime state (state.json/history/recap) + bought-sheet PDFs stay ignored.
!data/sessions/1343673766487654464/
!data/sessions/1343673766487654464/characters.json

# Agent / editor / OS cruft
.claude/**
# ...but share the project skills + the team hook config; settings.local.json stays local.
!.claude/skills
!.claude/skills/**
!.claude/settings.json
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
